&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulatory Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;: Ensure statistical methodologies and analyses meet the standards set by regulatory agencies such as CAP/CLIA, NYS, and the FDA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation and Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;: Provide leadership on the application of both common and cutting-edge statistical methods for studies of varying complexity.&lt;/p&gt;
