&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW156499425 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentStart SCXW156499425 BCX0&quot;&gt;Helsing develops artificial intelligence-enabled capabilities to protect and defend democracies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW156499425 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;We are growing our US operations, cultivating an ambitio&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW156499425 BCX0&quot;&gt;u&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW156499425 BCX0&quot;&gt;s and committed team of mission-driven professionals to apply their skills to solve challenging problems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW156499425 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW147604974 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW147604974 BCX0&quot;&gt;Are you ready to shape how a leading defense AI company wins its most critical opportunities? As the Proposal and Capture Manager at Helsing, you will own and orchestrate the end-to-end bid lifecycle — from opportunity qualification through to contract award. This is more than compliance with checklists and document formatting;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW147604974 BCX0&quot;&gt;it&#39;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW147604974 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;an opportunity to craft the narratives that bring breakthrough AI capabilities to the warfighter, working at the intersection of strategy, technology, and commercial delivery. If you thrive in fast-paced, high-stakes environments where your work directly enables the fielding of game-changing defense technology, we want to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW147604974 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The day-to-day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
