&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Become a BAYADA DSP for Rewarding Work and Competitive Pay!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care is currently seeking &lt;strong&gt;Direct Support Professionals (DSP)&lt;/strong&gt; to join the team in Centre County PA. BAYADA’s special needs caregivers - Direct Support Professionals DSPs - work one-on-one in home and community settings as a companion and mentor for individuals with intellectual or developmental disability to help them reach their full potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Looking for a new job opportunity? One that rewards you with both meaningful work and weekly income? With our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Direct Support Professional &lt;/strong&gt;position, you can work one-on-one with individuals with intellectual and developmental disabilities (I/DD) to help them live better lives at home and in their communities! You’ll teach them to do things for themselves, helping them live more independent, purposeful lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Make an Impact:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide personal care assistance (dressing, grooming, basic hygiene)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accompany clients on errands and appointments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spend time on the client’s favorite hobbies and activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with everyday tasks, such as meal preparation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in community integration activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Schedule:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay rates and weekly pay!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible scheduling (part-time, various shifts)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Short commute times (we try to match opportunities near your home)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits You’ll Love:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Scholarship and development opportunities, free courses, and on-the-job training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recognition &amp;amp; Rewards:&lt;/strong&gt; Recognition programs, referral bonuses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Positive Work Environment:&lt;/strong&gt; Stable and supportive work environment with around the clock clinical support and a team environment that cares&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid Time Off:&lt;/strong&gt; PTO (paid time off) and paid holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other Benefits: &lt;/strong&gt;401(k) with company match, employer-paid life insurance, employee assistance program (EAP)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications for Our Support Professionals:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
