&lt;li&gt;One year experience working or volunteering with intellectual and development disabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High school diploma or equivalent&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;18 years of age or older&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Details:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
