&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Here’s&amp;nbsp;a summary of the role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:300,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:300,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ready to be both the conductor&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;the lead musician&amp;nbsp;of your own business lines AND for a #1 market leader?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If so,&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/yukuan/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;Yu-Kuan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;Lin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;hiring a VP of Product Management who can set a bold product vision&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;roll up their sleeves to build alongside a high‑performing team&amp;nbsp;her at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.diligent.com/&quot;&gt;Diligent&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;#1 market leader in Governance, Risk &amp;amp; Compliance tech and used by 75% of Fortune 500 Boards.&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;shape the future of our&amp;nbsp;core product—the largest and&amp;nbsp;strategic growth engines&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;$7B revenue&amp;nbsp;company—owning&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;multi‑year strategy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;AI innovation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;revenue‑tied outcomes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;You will additionally be the #1 product leader for 2 business lines – our non-profit &amp;amp; government sector governance solutions.&amp;nbsp;If&amp;nbsp;you have experience being the head of product at a fast-growing growth company or tier 1 tech company, and lead by doing (not just directing), this is your stage to drive impact at executive altitude while still getting hands‑on where it matters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
